  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.22062643"
    description: >-
      Version DOI for release 0.4.0. Each release gets its own, minted when
      Zenodo archives it: 0.3.0 is 10.5281/zenodo.22050721, 0.2.0 is
      10.5281/zenodo.22047617 and 0.1.0 is 10.5281/zenodo.22045595. The ones for
      0.5.0 and 0.6.0 are added here once Zenodo has archived those releases;
      until then the concept DOI above resolves to the most recent version.
